            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Builders Are Offering Mortgage-Rate Discounts. Home Buyers Aren\u2019t Biting.",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "D.R. Horton  which builds roughly one in every seven new homes in the U.S. and has its own financing arm, is offering 3.99% mortgages to buyers.  The last time it had to offer home buyers such a deep discount was during the global financial crisis.  Profit margins have taken a hit from the rising cost of these incentives, so builders have decided to slow construction and wait for demand to recover.",
