            "title": "AMH (American Homes 4 Rent): One-Off Gain Drives Margin Beat, Clouding Forward Earnings Narrative",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "American Homes 4 Rent (AMH) reported a net profit margin of 22.9%, up from 20.9% the previous year, while earnings grew 17.2% year-over-year. However, this pace fell short of its five-year average annual growth rate of 31.6%. The most recent results were boosted by a significant one-off gain of $230.8 million. Looking ahead, earnings are forecast to decline by 4.2% per year and revenue growth is expected to lag behind the wider US market. Investors weighing these numbers are presented with a...",
